  "steps": [
    "To a pan on medium heat add 1½ cups of lotus seeds aka fox nuts (makhana). Dry roast them for 6-7 minutes till nice and crispy. Now to a bowl add 2 cups of whisked yogurt. Add all the roasted makhana, Now add A pinch of asafoetida (hing), ½ tsp chaat masala, ½ tsp black pepper powder, 1 chopped green chilli, ½ tsp cumin powder, 1½ tbsp jaggery powder, 1 tsp salt, Mix it all really well.",
    "Now throw in 50g pomegranate seeds and ½ a handful of freshly chopped coriander.",
    "Give it one final mix and it’s ready to serve!"
  ],
